WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:36.420
For a hundred years the Astragius galaxy
had been split by war.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.210
I was ordered into an operation
whose details were kept from me.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:45.000
There, my destiny was changed
the moment I saw her.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:50.710
She was apparently the military's greatest secret.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:54.500
She was known as the Prototype.

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:59.630
Escape

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:06.210
I had managed to escape the police, but hadn't
been able to take the Prototype with me.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:12.630
I didn't even notice the airborne AT units
drifting down like snow.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.710
An expert raid.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.750
Now I'm sure Chirico is working for the military.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.290
There's still too much that's unexplained.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:39.130
He could simply be a decoy.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.790
A decoy?

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.710
Whatever he is, everything's gone to hell
since he showed up.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:49.710
It's your fault for not taking care of him sooner.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.210
If we can get to the airport
we'll be able to get away.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.290
Right, if we can steal a chopper or a VTOL.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:20.960
Hey, Chirico!

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.960
How long are you just gonna sit and brood?

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:26.290
Smile! We're saying goodbye to this city at last!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:27.500
Goodbye?

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:30.790
Yeah. This car runs straight to the airport.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.170
Escaping by air's the only way left now.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:15.880
By order of Melkian military command Uoodo
has been occupied by an airborne AT unit.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:20.040
City security police will drop their weapons
and surrender unconditionally.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:25.500
Any attempts to move without permission or
to defy us will be answered with deadly force!

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:32.630
Chief Iskui, disarm and send out a representative
who will tell us whether you surrender or not.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:38.040
I repeat: Chief Iskui, disarm and
send out a representative...

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.000
Army Intelligence.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.670
So, they've begun their
investigation of the Society.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.330
He's only linked it to a few people.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.880
There's no way he can know
the details of the whole Society.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.290
Message from AT teams outside of town:

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:58.080
Uoodo is now completely
surrounded and occupied.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:01.250
Aerial group eight is standing by at the airport.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:06.080
We have to sweep the police from
inside the city and take full control.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:10.420
If an attack starts,
they'll try to move the Prototype.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:13.210
Sir, I'll have security tightened inside of the city.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:17.000
The situation's tense, but no need to panic.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.750
Issue orders to resist by any means
at your disposal.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.960
But how long are we to try and hold out?

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:31.080
I see. Melkia's mechanized AT corps is
the elite of the Gilgamesh military forces.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.580
You should be happy!

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:36.830
I'd think you'd be grateful to them for erradicating
a useless city like Uoodo for you.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:40.540
Yes, sir. I suppose so...

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:44.790
Don't worry. I'll concentrate on
our emergency procedures.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:46.500
Borough.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.920
Transport the Prototype out of the city
as soon as the attack begins.

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:53.420
We'll send our people to meet you.

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:54.830
Understood, sir.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.580
They've begun moving the Prototype.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.170
All units, return fire!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.750
What?!

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:54.250
Are you out of your mind? Say that again!

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:58.500
I still have work to do in the city.

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:00.500
You've gotta be kidding!

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.580
We risked our lives saving you
so you could escape with us!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:07.380
It's true. I said you were our friend,
so you should run with us.

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:10.920
He's gonna go back
no matter what you say to him.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.460
God, this guy's a pain!

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:15.630
Okay, Chirico.
Our association ends right here and now!

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:16.920
Remember that!

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:20.130
If we ever meet again,
your life means nothing to us!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.750
Vanilla, stop! Chirico's getting off!

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:26.670
Right! Right!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:27.960
Vanilla, wait!

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:39.000
Did the war start again?

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.630
Nobody told me about it.

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:44.130
What are you doing, Chirico?

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.380
Chirico!

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.210
He likes fighting!

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.960
He used to be a Red Shoulder, remember?

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.250
Chirico, wait!

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.210
Military Armored Troopers.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:22.170
Both sides are now out to steal the Prototype.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:27.420
I went on the mission believing I was
attacking a secret enemy base.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.960
Orders are orders in the military.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.130
But instead, I wound up fighting allies.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.790
That was where I first met the Prototype.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:46.330
That secret base was a research center
investigating the creation of a Perfect Soldier.

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:50.500
I helped them to steal the Prototype.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:53.710
Just a tool for the conspirators.

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:59.710
And Iskui was one of the guys
who used you, right?

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:04.040
Yeah. I've been hunted by both
the police and the military.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:09.290
I see. That's why you've got it in for the cops.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.670
Dirty bastards!

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.290
No kidding.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.460
Even I can't forgive something that low!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:17.290
The conspiracy that used me
seems to have some big plan.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:21.420
They're trying to find the secret of
a fully functional PS.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.420
PS?

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:23.420
Yeah...

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:28.210
A human whose nervous system has been
modified for combat. A Perfect Soldier.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:31.710
That's so cruel! Just changing a person's body!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.040
It isn't human!

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.750
Doesn't surprise me one bit!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.670
Killing people is the military's business!

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:41.380
Stop it with the eyes!

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:45.420
Every time he looks at me that way,
he gives me the creeps!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.420
Chirico can be real gloomy sometimes.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:55.380
All right! All right! I'll do it! Okay, Pops?

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:59.710
We wouldn't just be facing the cops this time.

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.790
We've never had to deal with the army before.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:04.750
You're not going to try to escape?

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.130
A war's started.

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:09.420
I don't know if the airport's an option now.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.250
We're gonna have to wait for things to calm down.

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.790
They've turned this city into hell again.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.460
Any word from headquarters yet?

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.500
Yes, sir! We just got it.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.210
Reinforcements aren't coming.
Fight on to the last man.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.040
They're just leaving us to die! Son of a...!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:52.500
Damn!

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:53.830
He's dead.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:57.170
And our one lead to the Society is cut.

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.630
Where's the Prototype?!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:29.670
Is the Prototype in there?

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.670
Captain! The back seat's empty.

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:32.580
What?!

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:38.040
Shit! We've been tricked! Contact the base!

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.920
For crying out loud!
Do they have to blow everything up?!

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:45.210
Can't really hold your fire in a situation like this.

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:46.540
Tell me about it.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.380
HQ to all units! HQ to all units!

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:51.380
Proceed at once to sector 98-S.

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:54.130
Prototype has abandoned the limousine
and is escaping on foot.

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:58.290
Good thing the radio lived through it.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.210
Sector 98-S...

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.420
That place'll be filthy with cops since that's...

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.210
The jijirium storage site.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.330
It has to be it.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:09.040
No kidding. Well, we've already scouted it.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.210
It's ours for the taking. Let's go!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.210
Open up!

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:38.670
We just have a couple of coffins in here.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.000
Where are you going?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.000
To the cemetary, near the processing station.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:47.380
Surely you wouldn't tell us no at a time like this.

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.380
Open them up!

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.080
Open them?

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.330
It's just the bodies of an old man and lady.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:58.670
Their heads were blown off.
Brains everywhere. Very nasty.

00:13:58.670 --> 00:13:59.960
I said open them!

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.630
I'll open them if you insist.

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:05.630
Do you really want to see
splattered brains that badly?

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:07.040
Here.

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.000
Never mind! Go!

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.630
Of course, of course.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:15.460
Okay! Let 'em through!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.670
Can't you go faster?

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.830
Quit your complaining... Why don't you do it?!

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:26.420
No thanks, I'm fine.

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.290
They're probably waiting for reinforcements.

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:45.500
Watch out for any police sentries.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.330
Gotcha. We'll be too easy to spot as a group.

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.000
Better split up and search.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:52.880
Coconna, you come with me.
And don't wander off!

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:53.960
Gotcha!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:58.330
We have to decide what to do with you now.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.630
I've a favor to ask.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.290
What?

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:03.290
I'd like to take a shower.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.250
They'll be here soon. Make it fast.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:09.250
Yes.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:27.040
What? Disappeared?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.920
No one came out of there?

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:31.670
No, sir. We just let a hearse drive through.

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:33.750
That hearse! Where did it go?!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:35.750
Towards the armory, sir.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.130
Get half our forces out there!

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.500
Surround the armory!

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:04.580
Chirico!

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:06.580
Fyana.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.290
Chirico...

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:16.670
Fyana...

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.170
I thought I'd never see you again.

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.080
We can get out of here.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.830
Our people are coming. It's dangerous!

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:30.380
Get out while you can!

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.830
My friends are here with me.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:33.830
If you come with me,
we'll make it out, somehow.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.170
I thought once maybe I could.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:39.130
But, if I don't go...

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:44.460
If I don't go with them, I'll die.

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:48.460
Fyana...

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:00.460
Chirico and his gang have broken in!

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:01.380
What?!

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.830
Reinforcements are approaching.
You have to get to the roof now!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.380
Come out of there. We have to leave!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.210
Get ready. We're going.

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:38.130
Why, you...!

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.330
What the...?!

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:12.330
What are you doing here?

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.500
Sorry.

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.920
I was just using this place to crash.

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.880
Get outta here before you get killed!

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:25.580
You're letting me go? Oh, thank you!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:29.630
Hey, your lens is really dirty.
Why don't I clean it for you?

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.630
What?! Never mind, just go!

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:34.960
Don't be like that! C'mon, tilt your head down.

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.830
Never mind! Get going!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:41.170
What are you doing?!
Wipe it off! Wipe that crap off!

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:44.920
Oops, sorry. Wrong spray.

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:47.130
What?! Why, you little-

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.170
It actually worked.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:53.500
Thanks to me.

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:55.290
Good work.

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:56.920
Chirico!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:03.170
With you in here, nothing can stop us.

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:04.290
Right, Chirico?

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.960
They're here.

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:33.960
Soon it'll all be over.

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:37.580
It's them!

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.790
Hurry!

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:46.880
Chirico...

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.420
Coconna, Gotho, get underground!

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:04.170
Gotcha!

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.500
Son of a...!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.960
What the... more reinforcements?

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.380
What?! Reinforcements from the Society?

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:27.540
God dammit...

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:29.210
This has gotten too hot. Evacuate!

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:04.420
The city of Uoodo was disappearing.

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:09.710
Vanilla... Gotho... Coconna...

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:12.210
Fyana...

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:14.880
Please...

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:17.080
Please don't leave me to be alone.

00:22:18.130 --> 00:22:19.460
Where are you?

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:21.630
Where have you all gone?

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:58.880
All has been consumed in flame.

00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:03.130
Smiling friends, budding love, and secrets as well.

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:05.920
But corruption remains the same everywhere.

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:08.130
All is shaken out and returned to the beginning.

00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:14.750
The soldier carries his dead soul within a
tired body to a land of mud and gun smoke.

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:17.790
Next time, "Assemble EX-10"

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:20.500
The mercenary sees love in no one.

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:24.290
Assemble EX-10

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
